DESCRIPTION:You probably already know me from reading the news. In 2018\, I
  dressed up as a sewing needle and hid inside a strawberry. There should b
 e a French word for the moment you realize a bald dude actually has a pony
 tail. I'm so used to failure that success represents an existential threat
 . "His mind works like no other” ★★★★★ – Chortle (UK) “The
  speed and frequency of his jokes is dizzying… Buckle up.” ★★★
